    <string name="cert_hint">The Install Cert button installs the active CA on this phone; Share CA sends its file to another phone; Backup CA copies ca.pem to the data folder so it can be picked up via file manager. Reset creates a new CA — reinstall it on every phone. Choose type “CA certificate”, without private key. If it worked before then fails after an update/IP change: delete the old CA on the phone, then reinstall the new CA. The server only serves HTTPS — install the CA on each phone so the Bitwarden app trusts it; the browser web-vault uses HTTPS too.</string>
